    "long_instructions": "### Use AI like an Illustrator\r\n\r\n1. Type a description of the image you want into the chat.\r\n   \r\n2. Include who is in it, what is happening, and how it should feel.\r\n\r\n3. Send it and see what the AI generates.\r\n4. Add more details to get closer to what you imagined.\r\n\r\n>Use your prompting strategy: Include a goal, context, and details.",
